<title> Hoarseness: Diagnosis.</title>
<graphic href="eee0101-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Hoarseness</label>
<path target="cell-9">Chronic, over 2 weeks</path>
<path target="cell-2">Acute, under 2 weeks</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-3">
<label>Viral laryngitis</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-4">
<label>Sinus disease, postnasal drip, and allergies?</label>
<path target="cell-5">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-6">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-8">
<label>Laryngopharyngeal reflux</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-12">
<label>ENT consultation</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-5">
<label>Consider antibiotics,<xref ref="cochrane4783" resource="acc015" /> nasal steroid, and nasal saline</label>
<path target="cell-7"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-9">
<label>Recent surgery, breathy hoarseness?</label>
<path target="cell-10">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-11">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-6">
<label>Cough, throat clearing, and globus?</label>
<path target="cell-8">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-10">
<label>Iatrogenic true vocal fold paresis&#x002F;paralysis</label>
<path target="cell-12"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-7">
<label>Supportive management, hydration, and voice rest</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-11">
<label>Otalgia, dysphagia, neck mass, and alcohol&#x002F;tobacco abuse?</label>
<path target="cell-13">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-14">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Associated URI?</label>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-4">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-13">
<label>Laryngeal malignancy</label>
<path target="cell-12"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-14">
<label>Professional voice user, vocal trauma or abuse?</label>
<path target="cell-15">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-12">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-15">
<label>True vocal fold polyp&#x002F;cyst&#x002F;nodule</label>
<path target="cell-12"></path>
</cell>
